{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>The one lamb.</b> Rashi explained: even though it was already stated in the section of ואתה תצוה, that was an admonition for the days of ordination, and here it is a command for the generations. And if you ask: there, in the section of תצוה, it explicitly says לדורותיכם — one may answer, לדורותיכם means two generations and no more, and therefore this verse, in which צו is written, which implies immediate urgency, is needed — from here and for the generations."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:00.150796817Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}